<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90772" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρό-χοος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόχους</span></b> , ἡ: acc. sg. written <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1121
				</span></i>
			 (Naucratis, <span class="entity">vii/vi B.C.</span>): nom. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόχοι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1026.25
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>); dat. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόχουσι</span> is f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				435
			</span></i>; acc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					5.2.7
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				5.23
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προχέω</span>):—<i>vessel
				for pouring out, jug</i>, esp. <i>ewer for pouring water upon
				the hands</i> of guests, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.136
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				785
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				430
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.27
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Xenarch.
				7.14
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wine-jug</i> from which the cupbearer pours into the cups,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.397
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Thessal. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήκυθος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Clitarch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.495c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a liquid
			measure, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.422
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 ii 10
			</span></i>, al. (<span class="entity">Tauromenium</span>).</div>
